  "description": "Classic Toury is a 750W fat tire electric bike for adults, offered in black with a High-Step frame and 26 × 4-inch tires. Clearance pricing, seven-speed gearing, throttle control and an included rear rack make it an option for commuting and outdoor rides. Why buy Classic Toury at its clearance price? Classic Toury pairs clearance pricing with a 6061 aluminum frame, Shimano seven-speed gearing, Tektro mechanical disc brakes and LG battery cells. These established components bring everyday riding capability to an affordable fat tire electric bike for commuting and off-road trips. Can one all-terrain ebike cover roads and off-road rides? Classic Toury has been tested on mountain roads, rough trails, sand, snow, grass and muddy routes, as well as paved roads. Its 26 × 4-inch fat tires make this all-terrain electric bike for adults an option for commuting and off-road exploring. How does 750W power assist your ride? Classic Toury uses a 750W rear hub motor to assist with starts, hills and daily travel. Five pedal-assist levels let you choose your support, while the half-twist throttle offers motor power without pedaling. Shimano seven-speed gearing adds control over your cadence. Who is the Classic Toury High-Step designed for? The black High-Step frame pairs 26-inch wheels with an adjustable saddle and handlebar position. This commuter electric bike suits riders who prefer a traditional frame, with a 27.6-inch standover height to compare against their inseam before choosing their fit. How do lights and reflective tires improve visibility? A 45-lux headlight illuminates the route ahead, while the integrated tail light makes the bike visible from behind. Reflective tire stripes catch light from other road users, adding side visibility to this fat tire electric bike on evening commutes and neighborhood rides. Can this utility ebike carry daily essentials? An included rear rack and full fenders make Classic Toury a utility ebike for everyday plans. The 350 lb total payload covers the rider, cargo and added accessories. Compatible baskets and bags can adapt the rack for shopping or commuting.",
